Scope and exclusions
--------------------

This license covers the source files authored in this directory: usctri.js,
usctri_v3.js, usctri.css, usctri_res.html, the interface images (1.png, 2.png,
3.png, back25.png, ferme.gif, ouvert.gif) and the accompanying documentation.

It does NOT cover:

  - The competition and athlete data served from Google Sheets at runtime,
    which belongs to US Créteil Triathlon and the athletes concerned.
  - jQuery, loaded at runtime from a CDN and distributed under the MIT license.
  - Any third-party material archived in subdirectories, which remains the
    property of its respective owners.
